{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/about_this_game_01.png?t=1751172644\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no escape. No guidance. Just the wind through dead branches\u2026 and something moving in the fog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Everstill Valley</strong> is a slow-burning survival horror experience set in a decaying, dreamlike wilderness. Scavenge what you can. Manage your hunger, thirst, and sanity. And always keep an eye on the trees \u2014 <strong>something is out there</strong>, and it doesn\u2019t stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/stalker.gif?t=1751172644\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore <strong>unsettling locations</strong> that feel misplaced: a phone booth deep in the forest. A metro tunnel that goes nowhere. A mountain-sized husk kneeling to the sky. Nothing makes sense here \u2014 and the longer you stay, the harder it becomes to trust your own thoughts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/about_this_game_02.png?t=1751172644\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore and endure</strong> a surreal, open-ended forest wilderness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/foraging.gif?t=1751172644\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage survival needs</strong>: hunger, thirst, fatigue, health, and sanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forage by day</strong>, <strong>fear the night</strong>: where something stalks you slowly, always visible, never stopping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover forgotten structures</strong>: abandoned homes, strange ruins, and impossible architecture</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/house.gif?t=1751172644\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day/night cycle</strong> with dynamic fog, lighting, and events tied to time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimalist UI &amp; lo-fi visuals</strong> evoke PSX-era horror, letting atmosphere take the lead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No combat</strong>. Just you, the dark, and your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How long can you survive when even your mind begins to break?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3411120?t=1751172644","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/83fd28ee2cdf814673a81153aaa51a86453b40d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751172644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/13a226b2974557f758523b308461af11313c51fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751172644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/13a226b2974557f758523b308461af11313c51fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751172644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Subtitle O