=1751172644\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Manage survival needs</strong>: hunger, thirst, fatigue, health, and sanity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forage by day</strong>, <strong>fear the night</strong>: where something stalks you slowly, always visible, never stopping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover forgotten structures</strong>: abandoned homes, strange ruins, and impossible architecture</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/extras/house.gif?t=1751172644\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Day/night cycle</strong> with dynamic fog, lighting, and events tied to time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Minimalist UI &amp; lo-fi visuals</strong> evoke PSX-era horror, letting atmosphere take the lead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No combat</strong>. Just you, the dark, and your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How long can you survive when even your mind begins to break?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Pixel Army Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411120/619e70dfd7c997bfba1b0abd2b815f1b37115aaa/header.jpg?t=1751172644","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257160247,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160247/movie480.mp4?t=1751143644","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257160247/mov